    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730282294356\" id=\"item-6721fd9bca1bd562030df8a3\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-d7d907a8db01e318be96\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us</strong>: Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> This home boasts five generously sized bedrooms, each designed with comfort and elegance in mind. Large windows in each room ensure plenty of natural light and offer serene views of the surrounding landscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> Includes two modern bathrooms that are both stylish and functional, with premium fixtures, clean lines, and high-quality finishes. The master bathroom features a spacious layout with a luxurious touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Room:</strong> The expansive living room is the heart of the home, featuring plush carpeting and ample space for both relaxing and entertaining. Its large windows not only illuminate the space with natural light but also provide picturesque views of the outdoors.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen:</strong> A state-of-the-art kitchen equipped with modern appliances and sleek cabinetry. The layout includes a central island and extends into a dining area, making it perfect for family meals and hosting guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> A convenient single-car garage provides secure parking and additional storage space, complementing the home\u2019s layout and design.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Area:</strong> The property is situated on a generous plot of land, featuring a beautifully maintained garden and a spacious deck that is ideal for outdoor entertaining and relaxation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Constructed with attention to detail and using only high-quality materials, this home at Old Mill Road offers a luxurious living experience in Auckland. It's an ideal residence for a growing family or anyone looking for a spacious and inviting home in a beautiful location. </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;672200e4c6c96406892d82c6&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;672200e4c6c96406892d82c6&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730258888192_404402\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-con